  "description_en": "Bundle packs that group a theme, plugins and a home block layout by industry. In “Apply bundle” an admin picks what to apply (theme, plugins, home block preset) and the site installs and applies them at once. Plugins go through the v10.5 permission consent, and the result is recorded in audit_logs(bundle_apply) when 29_v108 is installed.",
